#. Key:	PostSensorBody
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11502)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11502)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,PostSensorBody"
