#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2119)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2119)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalNotebookThought"
msgid "공방에 남아 있던 오빠 공구다. 늘 쓰던 튜닝 해머만 없네."
msgstr "工房の倉庫から引き取ってきた、お兄ちゃんの調律工具。いつも持ち歩いてたチューニングハンマーだけがない。"

#. Key:	ArrivalVoicemailPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2131)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2131)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalVoicemailPrompt"
msgid "예전 휴대폰 상자 열기"
msgstr "古いスマホの箱を開ける"

#. Key:	ArrivalVoicemailThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2132)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2132)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalVoicemailThought"
msgid "“유담아, 나 이사했어. 집이 좀 이상하긴 한데… 와 보면 알아. 문 두드리면 알지? 둘, 하나.” 뒤에서 뭔가 긁히는 소리가 들린다."
msgstr "「ユダム、引っ越したよ。ちょっと変な家だけど…来れば分かる。ノックでわかるよな？ 二回、一回。」奥で何かがこすれる音がする。"

#. Key:	ArrivalStoreBellPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2144)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2144)
