#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(849)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(849)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Seen"
msgid "라디오를 창밖 쪽으로 돌려놓으셨다. 골목까지 들리겠다."
msgstr "ラジオを外に向けてある。路地まで聞こえそう。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(861)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(861)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1"
msgid "방수포도 카트도 치워졌다. 콘크리트에 자국만 남았다."
msgstr "防水シートもカートも片づけられた。コンクリートに跡だけが残っている。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(866)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(866)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1b"
msgid "관리실 창은 그날 밤 뒤로 불이 한 번도 안 켜졌다."
msgstr "管理人室の窓には、あの夜から一度も明かりがついていない。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(872)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(872)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay2"
msgid "그 뒤로 새벽 두 번을 401호 할머니와 벽 앞에서 같이 대답했다."
msgstr "それから二度の明け方、401号室のおばあさんと一緒に、壁の前で返事をした。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(879)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(879)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay3Seen"
msgid "옥상 탱크 옆, 오빠가 쉬던 자리는 아직 그대로다."
msgstr "屋上の貯水槽の横、お兄ちゃんが休んでいた場所は、まだそのままだ。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(885)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(885)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay4"
msgid "방을 빼고 403호 열쇠를 돌려줬다."
msgstr "部屋を引き払って、403号室の鍵を返した。"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(896)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(896)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNote1"
msgid "붙어 있던 쪽지는 다 떼어지고, 하늘색 쪽지 한 장이 새로 붙어 있다."
msgstr "貼られていた紙は全部はがされて、水色のメモが一枚、新しく貼ってある。"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(900)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(900)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNote2"
msgid "그동안 시끄럽다고만 해서 죄송합니다. 303호"
msgstr "これまで、うるさいとばかり言ってすみませんでした。303号室"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(914)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(914)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews1"
msgid "무영로 다세대주택 벽체에서 남성 유해 발견 … 실종 1년 만"
msgstr "ムヨン路の集合住宅、壁の中から男性の遺体…失踪から1年"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(923)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(923)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokB"
msgid "건물주 목씨 소재 파악 중… 관리실 비운 채 연락 끊겨"
msgstr "建物所有者のモク氏、所在を確認中…管理人室を空けたまま連絡取れず"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokA
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(927)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(927)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokA"
msgid "경찰, 건물주 목씨 상대로 사건 경위 조사"
msgstr "警察、建物所有者のモク氏から経緯を聴取"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(936)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(936)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3Seen"
msgid "관리실 안쪽 방은 방음 시공돼 있었다"
msgstr "管理人室の奥の部屋には防音工事が施されていた"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(943)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(943)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3"
msgid "민원 대장 두 벌과 이틀치 자재 영수증이 확보됐다"
msgstr "二冊の苦情台帳と、二日分の資材の領収書が押収された"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(954)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(954)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Seen"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 “그 뒤로 새벽마다 깼다”며 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "元入居者のソ氏は「あれ以来、明け方になると目が覚めた」と話し、出頭の意向を示した"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(961)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(961)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 변호인을 통해 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "元入居者のソ氏は、弁護人を通じて出頭の意向を示した"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(972)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(972)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Recorder"
msgid "건물 녹화 장치는 저장 디스크가 빠진 채로 발견됐다"
msgstr "建物の録画装置は、記録用ディスクが抜かれた状態で見つかった"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Calendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(981)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(981)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Calendar"
msgid "관리실 벽 달력은 지난해 7월 26일에 표시된 채 멈춰 있었다"
msgstr "管理人室の壁のカレンダーは、昨年7月26日に印がついたまま止まっていた"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Roster
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(993)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(993)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Roster"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 사건 당일 야간 근무 중 들은 소리를 진술했다"
msgstr "近くのコンビニの店員は、事件当日の夜勤中に聞いた音について証言した"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionStart
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(314)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionStart"
msgid "[7월 27일 · 가까이] 얕은 숨소리  ·  [오른쪽] 물 흐르는 소리"
msgstr "［7月27日・すぐそば］浅い息づかい  ·  ［右］水の流れる音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionWaterShift
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(372)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(372)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionWaterShift"
msgid "[머리 위] 배관 크게 덜컹거리는 소리"
msgstr "［頭上］配管が大きくがたつく音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionSecondDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(390)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(390)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionSecondDawn"
msgid "[7월 28일] 발소리와 불경 소리가 점점 멀어진다"
msgstr "［7月28日］足音とお経が遠ざかっていく"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionThirdDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(458)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(458)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionThirdDawn"
msgid "[7월 29일] 벽을 긁는 소리"
msgstr "［7月29日］壁を引っかく音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionDohaCall
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(510)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(510)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionDohaCall"
msgid "[벽 안] 둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "［壁の中］二回、間を置いて、一回"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionHwangReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(529)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(529)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionHwangReply"
msgid "[아주 멀리] 같은 박자로 대답하는 소리"
msgstr "［ずっと遠く］同じリズムで返事をする音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionFourthDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(549)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(549)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionFourthDawn"
msgid "[7월 30일] 느리고 약한 숨소리"
msgstr "［7月30日］ゆっくりとした弱い息づかい"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionFinalDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(562)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(562)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionFinalDawn"
msgid "[7월 31일] 다섯 번째 새벽"
msgstr "［7月31日］五度目の明け方"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionNoReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(579)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(579)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionNoReply"
msgid "[벽 안] 두 번 두드리는 소리  ·  대답 없음"
msgstr "［壁の中］二回ノックする音  ·  返事はない"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionBreathOnly
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(596)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(596)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionBreathOnly"
msgid "[가까이] 희미한 숨소리"
msgstr "［すぐそば］かすかな息づかい"

#. Key:	FinalRevealBegin
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1362)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1362)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealBegin"
msgid "위에서부터 천천히 비춰 본다."
msgstr "上から、ゆっくり照らしてみる。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealSkull
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1439)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1439)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealSkull"
msgid "고개가 옷깃 쪽으로 푹 숙여져 있다."
msgstr "頭が襟元のほうへ、深く垂れている。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealRibs
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1467)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1467)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealRibs"
msgid "갈비뼈 사이에 석고 가루가 쌓여 있다. 오래됐어."
msgstr "肋骨のあいだに石膏の粉が積もってる。だいぶ経ってる。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealShoes
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1513)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1513)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealShoes"
msgid "한쪽 발이 안으로 꺾여 있다. 방수포, 카트 바퀴… 오빠야."
msgstr "片方の足が内側に曲がってる。防水シート、カートの車輪……お兄ちゃんだ。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1669)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1669)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealKnockCaption"
msgid "멀리서 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "遠くで二回ノックする音"

#. Key:	MokHansooFinalLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1714)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1714)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooFinalLine"
msgid "그만해요. 덮어야 돼. 이거… 말해 봤자 아무도 안 믿어요."
msgstr "やめなさい。ふさがなきゃいけないんだ。こんなこと……話したって、誰も信じませんよ。"

#. Key:	MokHansooName
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1720)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1720)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooName"
msgid "목한수"
msgstr "モク・ハンス"

#. Key:	YudamName
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1735)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1735)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamName"
msgid "백유담"
msgstr "ペク・ユダム"

#. Key:	FinaleDragCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1886)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1886)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinaleDragCaption"
msgid "석고 가루 위로 무겁게 끌리는 소리"
msgstr "石膏の粉の上を重く引きずる音"

#. Key:	FinalConfrontationAfter
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1983)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1983)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalConfrontationAfter"
msgid "나를 지나쳐서 관리인을 따라갔어."
msgstr "私の横を通り過ぎて、管理人を追っていった。"

#. Key:	MokRetreatStepsCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2043)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2043)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokRetreatStepsCaption"
msgid "뒷걸음치는 발소리"
msgstr "後ずさりする足音"

#. Key:	EvictionPostedCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2128)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2128)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionPostedCaption"
msgid "4층 복도에서 종이 붙이는 소리"
msgstr "4階の廊下で紙を貼る音"

#. Key:	CleaningDrainThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2222)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2222)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CleaningDrainThought"
msgid "아래쪽 배관으로 물이 빠진다."
msgstr "下の配管から水が抜けていく。"

#. Key:	FloatBypassThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2224)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2224)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FloatBypassThought"
msgid "급수관에서도 물소리가 난다."
msgstr "給水管からも水の音がする。"

#. Key:	TransferPumpThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2225)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2225)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TransferPumpThought"
msgid "펌프가 돌기 시작했다."
msgstr "ポンプが動き出した。"

#. Key:	P5OverflowAlarm
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2287)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2287)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P5OverflowAlarm"
msgid "물이 넘친다. 배수 밸브를 안 열었어."
msgstr "水があふれてる。排水バルブを開けてなかった。"

#. Key:	P5PressureAlarm
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2291)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2291)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P5PressureAlarm"
msgid "펌프가 멈췄다. 고장등 꺼질 때까지 기다리자."
msgstr "ポンプが止まった。故障ランプが消えるまで待とう。"

#. Key:	P5MaskReady
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2496)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2496)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P5MaskReady"
msgid "물 도는 동안엔 벽 치는 소리가 묻히겠다."
msgstr "水が回ってるあいだは、壁を叩く音もかき消されそう。"

#. Key:	NightFourRecordingArmed
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2508)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2508)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourRecordingArmed"
msgid "폰 녹음 켜 두자. 이번엔 뭐라도 남겨야 해."
msgstr "スマホの録音を回しておこう。今度こそ、何か残さないと。"

#. Key:	NightFourRecordingLifted
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2552)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2552)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourRecordingLifted"
msgid "폰을 보니 방금 그 소리가 다 찍혀 있다."
msgstr "スマホを見ると、さっきの音が全部録れている。"

#. Key:	P2PhoneKept
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2559)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2559)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P2PhoneKept"
msgid "녹음됐다. 이번엔 제대로 됐어."
msgstr "録れてる。今度はちゃんと録れた。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2689)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2689)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourStrikeFirst"
msgid "석고에 금이 갔다."
msgstr "石膏にひびが入った。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeSecond
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2691)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2691)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourStrikeSecond"
msgid "안이 비었어. 소리가 달라."
msgstr "中が空洞だ。音が違う。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeFourth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2692)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2692)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourStrikeFourth"
msgid "손이 저리다. 한 번만 더."
msgstr "手がしびれる。あと一回。"

#. Key:	Unit401ReplyCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2724)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2724)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Unit401ReplyCaption"
msgid "둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "二回、間を置いて、一回"

#. Key:	NightFourWallAnswerCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2810)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2810)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourWallAnswerCaption"
msgid "벽 안에서 둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "壁の中から、二回、間を置いて、一回"

#. Key:	NightFourPowerCut
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2861)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2861)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourPowerCut"
msgid "불이 나갔어. 밑에 누가 있어."
msgstr "電気が消えた。下に誰かいる。"

#. Key:	BreakerCutCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2867)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2867)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BreakerCutCaption"
msgid "차단기 내리는 소리"
msgstr "ブレーカーを落とす音"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyFoam
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3009)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3009)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyFoam"
msgid "관리실 안쪽 방이요. 문틈까지 계란판 붙여 놓으셨더라고요."
msgstr "管理人室の奥の部屋です。ドアの隙間まで、卵パックを貼ってましたね。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyCalendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3016)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3016)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyCalendar"
msgid "달력이요. 26일에 동그라미 치고, 그 뒤로 한 장도 안 넘기셨죠."
msgstr "カレンダーです。26日に丸をつけて、それから一枚もめくってませんよね。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyGlove
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3023)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3023)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyGlove"
msgid "5층 장갑에 석고가 굳어 있던데요. 아저씨 거예요?"
msgstr "5階に軍手が片方ありました。兄の手には、ふたまわり大きいです。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyRecorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3030)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3030)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyRecorder"
msgid "녹화기 하드는 언제 빼셨어요?"
msgstr "録画機のハードディスク、いつ抜いたんですか？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyInnerRoom
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3037)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3037)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyInnerRoom"
msgid "안쪽 방에 뭘 계속 돌려 놓으셨던데요. 그래서 못 들으셨어요?"
msgstr "奥の部屋で、何かをずっと回しっぱなしにしてましたよね。だから聞こえなかったんですか？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyWind
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3044)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3044)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyWind"
msgid "옥상에서 바람 들어 봤어요. 바람이 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 불어요?"
msgstr "屋上で風の音を聞いてみました。風が、二回、間を置いて、一回なんて吹き方をしますか？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3055)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3055)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyPack"
msgid "탱크 옆에 꽁초 여섯 개요. 거기 앉아서 쉬던 사람이 있었다고요."
msgstr "貯水槽の横に吸い殻が六本。あそこに座って休んでた人がいたんですよ。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyBowl
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3062)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3062)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyBowl"
msgid "401호 할머니는 아직도 물그릇을 갈아 놓으세요. 매일요."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさんは、今も水入れの水を替えてるんです。毎日。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPills
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3069)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3069)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyPills"
msgid "서일영 씨 아세요? 골목에 그분 약봉투가 떨어져 있던데요."
msgstr "路地に落ちてた薬の袋に、ソ・イリョンさんの名前がありました。"

#. Key:	EndingBRecordingOffCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3224)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3224)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBRecordingOffCaption"
msgid "폰 녹음 끄는 소리"
msgstr "スマホの録音を止める音"

#. Key:	EndingAChoiceThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3232)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3232)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingAChoiceThought"
msgid "여기 내려놓자. 밖에 나가서 사람을 불러야 해."
msgstr "ここに置いていこう。外に出て、人を呼ばなきゃ。"

#. Key:	EndingBChoiceThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3236)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3236)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBChoiceThought"
msgid "조금만 더 여기 있을게."
msgstr "もう少しだけ、ここにいるね。"

#. Key:	EndingBAnswerCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3422)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3422)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBAnswerCaption"
msgid "복도 끝에서 대답하듯 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "廊下の奥から、返事をするように二回ノックする音"

#. Key:	EndingBRingbackCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3504)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3504)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBRingbackCaption"
msgid "112 연결음"
msgstr "112の呼び出し音"

#. Key:	EndingCCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3670)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3670)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingCCaption"
msgid "아주 가까이서, 똑같이 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "すぐ近くで、同じように二回ノックする音"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(430)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(430)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticePrompt"
msgid "퇴거 통보문 읽기"
msgstr "退去通知を読む"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(434)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(434)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticeThought"
msgid "이번 주 안에 나가라고? 내가 밤에 올라간 걸 아는 거야."
msgstr "設備を無断で操作したから、今週中に出ていってほしいって。夜に上がったのを知ってるんだ。"

#. Key:	CleaningDrainPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(449)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(449)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CleaningDrainPrompt"
msgid "세척 배수 밸브 열기"
msgstr "排水バルブを開ける"

#. Key:	FloatBypassPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(462)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(462)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FloatBypassPrompt"
msgid "우회 밸브 열기"
msgstr "バイパスバルブを開ける"

#. Key:	TransferPumpPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(481)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(481)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TransferPumpPrompt"
msgid "이송 펌프 수동으로 돌리기"
msgstr "揚水ポンプを手動で動かす"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheetPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(505)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(505)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheetPrompt"
msgid "저수조 점검 메모"
msgstr "貯水槽の点検メモ"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheetTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(507)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(507)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheetTitle"
msgid "저수조 점검 메모 (2019.03)"
msgstr "貯水槽の点検メモ（2019.03）"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(509)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(509)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet1"
msgid "물이 넘친 날: 배수는 잠겨 있었고, 우회만 열려 있었음."
msgstr "水があふれた日：排水は閉じていて、バイパスだけが開いていた。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(510)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(510)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet2"
msgid "펌프가 멎은 날: 배수만 열고 돌림. 우회관에 물이 안 찼음."
msgstr "ポンプが止まった日：排水だけ開けて動かした。バイパス管に水が入っていなかった。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(511)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(511)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet3"
msgid "세척할 때는 자동 수위 조절을 쓰지 말 것."
msgstr "清掃時は自動水位調整を使わないこと。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(513)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(513)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet4"
msgid "고장등이 켜지면 손대지 말고 10초 정도 기다리세요."
msgstr "故障ランプがついたら、触らずに10秒ほど待ってください。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(514)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(514)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet5"
msgid "배관이 조용해지고 등이 꺼진 뒤 다시 돌리면 됩니다."
msgstr "配管が静かになってランプが消えたら、もう一度動かせば大丈夫です。"

#. Key:	WallBreakPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(564)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(564)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,WallBreakPrompt"
msgid "벽을 망치로 두드리기"
msgstr "金づちで壁を叩く"

#. Key:	EndingAPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(582)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(582)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingAPrompt"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 오빠 곁에 두고 물러나기"
msgstr "チューニングハンマーをお兄ちゃんのそばに置いて離れる"

#. Key:	EndingBPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(596)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(596)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBPrompt"
msgid "녹음 끄고 곁에 앉아 대답하기"
msgstr "録音を止めて、そばに座って返事をする"

#. Key:	KeyringPaperThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1292)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1292)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KeyringPaperThought"
msgid "열쇠 옆에 부동산 문자 뽑아 둔 게 있네."
msgstr "鍵の横に、不動産屋のメッセージを印刷したものが置いてある。"

#. Key:	ValveOpenPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1313)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1313)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ValveOpenPrompt"
msgid "열린 배관 밸브"
msgstr "開いている配管のバルブ"

#. Key:	ValveThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1362)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1362)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ValveThought"
msgid "물 내려가는 소리가 난다. 이제 벽에 귀를 대 보자."
msgstr "水が流れていく音がする。今度は壁に耳を当ててみよう。"

#. Key:	TuningHammerArrivalEcho
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1472)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1472)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TuningHammerArrivalEcho"
msgid "이사 온 날 옥상 문 너머에서 들린 그 소리다."
msgstr "引っ越してきた日に、屋上の扉の向こうから聞こえた音だ。"

#. Key:	TuningHammerListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1488)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1488)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TuningHammerListingThought"
msgid "목록에 있던 공구다. 이것까지 팔지는 못했네."
msgstr "出品に載ってた工具だ。これだけは売れなかったんだ。"

#. Key:	TunerCartThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1525)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1525)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TunerCartThought"
msgid "바퀴 하나가 깨졌네. 천장에서 들리던 소리랑 비슷하다."
msgstr "車輪が一つ壊れてる。天井から聞こえた音に似てる。"

#. Key:	AnnexRecognitionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1630)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1630)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,AnnexRecognitionThought"
msgid "CCTV에서 본 곳이다. 저 전구, 왼쪽으로 꺾이는 복도."
msgstr "防犯カメラで見た廊下だ。電球がひとつに、左に折れる通路。"

#. Key:	PlasterDatingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1652)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1652)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,PlasterDatingThought"
msgid "안쪽은 바싹 말랐는데, 바깥 실리콘은 덜 굳었어. 얼마 전에 또 막았나?"
msgstr "内側の石膏ボードはからからに乾いてるのに、外側のシリコンはまだ固まりきってない。最近ふさぎ直したのかな？"

#. Key:	TankAuditionCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1701)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1701)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionCaption"
msgid "[안쪽] 물이 아주 천천히 흐르는 소리"
msgstr "［内側］水がとてもゆっくり流れる音"

#. Key:	TankAuditionThoughtCrossed
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1716)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1716)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionThoughtCrossed"
msgid "탱크에 물이 가득 찼다. 벽 바로 뒤로 배관이 지나가네."
msgstr "貯水槽は水でいっぱいだ。壁のすぐ裏を配管が通ってる。"

#. Key:	TankAuditionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1720)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1720)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionThought"
msgid "이 밑으로 급수관이 내려가네."
msgstr "この下に給水管が下りてるんだ。"

#. Key:	ListenSilent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1741)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1741)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenSilent"
msgid "조용하네. 세 벽 다 똑같아."
msgstr "静かだ。三つの壁、どれも同じ。"

#. Key:	ListenSilentAgain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1746)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1746)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenSilentAgain"
msgid "조용하네. 여기도 똑같아."
msgstr "静かだ。ここも同じ。"

#. Key:	ListenSilentFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1750)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1750)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenSilentFirst"
msgid "조용하네."
msgstr "静かだ。"

#. Key:	ListenCavityFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1773)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1773)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenCavityFirst"
msgid "바로 뒤로 물이 흐른다. 소리가 길게 울리네."
msgstr "すぐ裏を水が流れてる。音が長く響く。"

#. Key:	ListenCavity
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1778)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1778)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenCavity"
msgid "바로 뒤로 물이 흐른다. 이 벽만 속이 빈 것 같아."
msgstr "すぐ裏を水が流れてる。この壁だけ、中が空洞みたい。"

#. Key:	ListenCavityUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1782)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1782)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenCavityUnread"
msgid "바로 뒤로 물이 흐른다. 이 벽만 소리가 달라. 왜 이러지?"
msgstr "すぐ裏を水が流れてる。この壁だけ音が違う。なんでだろう？"

#. Key:	ListenFar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1796)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1796)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenFar"
msgid "물소리가 멀리서 웅웅거리네."
msgstr "水の音が、遠くでくぐもって響いてる。"

#. Key:	ListenFarCompared
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1801)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1801)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenFarCompared"
msgid "여기선 물소리가 멀어. 아까 그 벽만 속이 비어 있었어."
msgstr "ここだと水の音が遠い。さっきの壁だけ、中が空洞だった。"

#. Key:	ListenFarComparedUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1805)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1805)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenFarComparedUnread"
msgid "여기선 물소리가 멀어. 아까 그 벽만 소리가 길게 울렸는데."
msgstr "ここだと水の音が遠い。さっきの壁だけ、音が長く響いたのに。"

#. Key:	KnockCavityFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1869)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1869)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockCavityFirst"
msgid "소리가 오래 울리네."
msgstr "音が長く響く。"

#. Key:	KnockCavity
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1874)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1874)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockCavity"
msgid "소리가 오래 울린다. 안이 비어 있어."
msgstr "音が長く響く。中が空洞になってる。"

#. Key:	KnockCavityUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1878)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1878)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockCavityUnread"
msgid "소리가 오래 울린다. 이 벽만 달라. 오빠였으면 왜 그런지 알았을 텐데."
msgstr "音が長く響く。この壁だけ違う。お兄ちゃんなら、なんでかわかったはずなのに。"

#. Key:	KnockSolid
